ILLUSTRATIVE PLACEHOLDER - NOT A REAL SPREADSHEET

This file stands in for a client fuel log for the sample refuse-fleet case.
Step 3 does NOT parse this file. The extracted values the demo uses live in
extracted.json in this directory, labelled illustrative. This placeholder keeps
the exact file name (fuel_log_2025.xlsx) the intake flow attaches, so the demo
runs fully offline without a spreadsheet reader.

Pretend contents (illustrative only):
  - 6 refuse trucks, daily odometer readings, Mon-Fri
  - ~120 km per truck per day
  - diesel litres per fill, roughly 55 L/100km
